  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nWhy does it throw an error to try and do `setSelectionRange` inside `input type=\"email\"`? I get this restriction for special inputs, such as date with segments, number etc, but email is literally just text with extra bells and whistles. What's the reason behind it not supporting `setSelectionRange`?",
